<title>FINLAND: HANDELSBANKEN FINLAND CUTS PRIME RATE TO 3.75 PCT.</title>
<headline>HANDELSBANKEN FINLAND CUTS PRIME RATE TO 3.75 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Handelsbanken's Finnish branch said in a statement on Thursday it will lower its prime interest rate to 3.75 percent from 4.00 percent effective November 4.</p>
<p>The bank justified the cut in the prime rate by referring to the prevailing level of market interest rates in Finland.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
